mo's plan begins as she  uses her body to produce these  undiluted sedatives one of which would  be enough to put gigantomachia to sleep  if it enters his mouth each student is  given one capsule  whilst minetta momo and mudman each lay  down traps that will hopefully trip  machia up  yaya rosu drops some explosives into the  ground whilst mudman makes the earth  pretty soft  so that her dynamite can then sink lower  meanwhile with minetta  he attaches some rope to his sticky  balls which will also be very useful in  a second  as planned machia trips up on the soft  ground  and falls face first into even more soft  ground  he tries to get back up but moneta's  balls are stuck to his chin  which means that other students like  sato and kendo they can pull on the rope  to try and stop him from getting back up  ibarra from class 1b wraps her thorns  around his neck  and all the students are chipping in in  one way or another  for example aoyama is going all out with  the lasers  and denki tries to electrocute the  league of villains but is seriously  injured by mr compress  before he can do that invisible girl and  a bunch of others  attempt to throw sedatives into makia's  mouth but the big guy exhales  pushing back most of the students with  his insane breath  daby follows this up with a wall of  flames that rapidly spreads through the  forest  and prevents those who are blown away  from getting closer  however mina activates her fireproof  acid man armor  and emerges from the fire with the  sedative in her hand  ready to throw mount lady gets up and  uses all of her strength  to grab gigantomachia by the draw and  open his mouth  makia gets angry because all he wants to  do is take the shortest route to  shigaraki  but naturally these heroes are now  making that a bit difficult  ashido hesitates because she recognizes  this voice  and realizes that he is the same  creature she encountered way back in  middle school  fear begins to consume her as the  sedative slips 